Requirements
• Python 3.9 or later
• Pygame library

Step 1: Clone the Repository
Open a terminal and run the following command to download the project:
 	git clone https://github.com/Stumpts/Shrimp-Wizard.git
cd Shrimp-Wizard
Step 2: Install Dependencies
Install the required Pygame library using pip:	
pip install pygame

If you are using Python 3 and pip is mapped to Python 2 on your system, use:
pip3 install pygame
Step 3: Run the Game
Navigate to the Code directory and run the main script:
cd Code
python main.py
On macOS or Linux, use python3 if python refers to Python 2:
python3 main.py
